how people’ll take it.

00:16:00.793 --> 00:16:02.670
So.
- Yeah.
- It's all good.

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.672
- So, but why do you think that is?

00:16:04.672 --> 00:16:06.382
Cuz I know there has
been different times

00:16:06.382 --> 00:16:08.634
