we know this is ours.

00:16:08.634 --> 00:16:10.010
We know we began this.”

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:13.097
Now, this person who maybe at the time had
a bigger platform is doing it.

00:16:13.097 --> 00:16:15.599
And people are believing
that it is their style.

00:16:15.599 --> 00:16:20.145
Like, how do you wrestle with kind of that
frustration of knowing that that's yours?

00:16:20.145 --> 00:16:23.315
