00:16:32.908 --> 00:16:34.702
- So I feel like that
was the first time the world

00:16:34.702 --> 00:16:38.080
all heard the flow, you know what I'm sayin’,
when it was Migos and Drake on a song, so.

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:42.376
And even with that,
like, even before that, I feel like

00:16:43.544 --> 00:16:45.254
nobody else was using it.

00:16:45.254 --> 00:16:47.047
Nobody else did it. Nobody else used it.

00:16:47.047 --> 00:16:49.466
So now when they come out
and say different people

00:16:49.466 --> 00:16:52.469
