I don’t understand how.
- Yeah.

00:16:52.469 --> 00:16:55.222
- Cuz even the people
they naming that influenced them,

00:16:55.222 --> 00:16:58.058
I know for a fact we influenced them too.
- Mmhmm.

00:16:58.058 --> 00:16:59.727
Have rappers, like, come up to you

00:16:59.727 --> 00:17:02.312
