you've had on on their sound?

00:17:02.312 --> 00:17:03.147
- Most definitely

00:17:03.147 --> 00:17:05.816
- Yeah?
- Most definitely.
- When has that happened?

00:17:06.442 --> 00:17:09.445
- You just gotta keep that to, you know, to myself.
- Yeah.

00:17:09.445 --> 00:17:13.490
- You know what I’m sayin’? I don't wanna discredit
no artist, but they know.

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:15.576
They know I'm the realest n---a alive

00:17:15.576 --> 00:17:18.162
