00:18:23.102 --> 00:18:26.730
- I was just young, you know what I’m sayin’?
Not—just ready to work everywhere.

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:30.109
Not paying attention to, like,
just, like, the business side of music.

00:18:30.109 --> 00:18:33.946
