- Yeah.
- I ain't give a f—I ain’t care about nothin’.

00:18:40.285 --> 00:18:44.373
- You can cuss. It’s fine.
- I was just goin’ crazy.
I done cussed about five times already.

00:18:44.373 --> 00:18:46.416
Well, yeah, but like, I was just,

00:18:46.416 --> 00:18:48.877
I was just goin’ crazy on “Culture I.”
I was just like,

00:18:50.003 --> 00:18:52.381
gas, on the gas, just ready to go, man.

00:18:52.381 --> 00:18:56.301
- Mmhmm.
- Now, I'm just, like, real mental about my moves

00:18:56.301 --> 00:18:59.221
