00:19:46.643 --> 00:19:49.396
- Not for me. I just feel like once
I'm at the top, I still,

00:19:49.396 --> 00:19:52.191
I gotta stay there, and I’ll do the same thing.

00:19:52.191 --> 00:19:54.359
I do the same thing going to the top,

00:19:54.359 --> 00:19:56.069
