more platinum records, more number ones.

00:20:43.951 --> 00:20:45.744
- So I know you produce as well.

00:20:45.744 --> 00:20:47.788
And I was talking to my friend
Gabe, who is somewhere—

00:20:47.788 --> 00:20:50.123
