00:21:37.963 --> 00:21:40.299
I did so many songs with so many people.

00:21:40.299 --> 00:21:42.551
I'd get Jay-Z on it.

00:21:42.551 --> 00:21:46.680
I'd get Jay-Z, Kanye and, uh...

00:21:49.933 --> 00:21:51.601
Kanye and Drake.

00:21:51.601 --> 00:21:53.937
Jay-Z, Kanye and Drake.
All on one song.

00:21:53.937 --> 00:21:56.356
